# Wish Upon a Star (bastok 64): 334 at NIGHT with the weather NONE (set by a GM: Bastok Markets never rolls it) and a
# full inventory: the four Bags of Cactus Stems do not fit, so npcUtil.completeQuest's giveItem fails first: not
# completed, the star kept. With room, 334 again completes it. Accepted by GM with a Fallen Star.
lists BastokMarkets/Enu/onTrade BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/334
char zone=BastokMarkets pos=-253.7,-13,-92.3 lvl=30
quest Bastok.WishUponAStar accepted
item FallenStar
login
weather 0                      # GM: the weather NONE
wait vana=10                   # 22:00: NIGHT
fill-inventory
trade Enu FallenStar x1        # NIGHT, NONE: 334
finish                         # the bags do not fit: not completed, the star kept
free-inventory
trade Enu FallenStar x1        # 334 again
finish                         # completed: four Bags of Cactus Stems, fame +50, the star taken
